      "writtenOn": "2024-06-21T05:16:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Question for clarification: Why do you only handle in teardown \"AP\" iface?\nDo we also need to handle in \"STA\" iface?\n\nIs your use case about AP off/on when STA is ON?\n\nIt seems to me that we should create a common method to handle teardown interface like subscribeRegDomainChange in SetupInterface.",
